    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rōbīgĭnōsus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūbīg-</span></b> ), a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>rusty.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strigilis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Stich. 1, 3, 77</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gladius (opp. splendidus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fronto Eloq. p. 230</span></i>
			 Mai: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">telum sanguine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. de Deo Socr. p. 45, 6</span></i>
			.— * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rubiginosis dentibus cuncta rodit,</span>”
				i.e. <i>envious</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					5, 28, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
